{"about_the_game":"<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2130300/extras/054c4cd202db45f5d2ed3a91c63bda94.avif?t=1746589459\" width=613 height=367 /></span><br>Eclipse: Shine of Dawn is a game with a Fantasy RPG aesthetic that combines the best of storytelling and hack 'n slash elements, unique characters, memorable enemies, and immersive puzzles in a pleasant setting, whether to think, admire, or beat down hordes of monsters. As you progress through the story, unlock new weapons, abilities, and emotions that deliver unique moments in a completely epic way.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2130300/extras/b0a8f110f027c2048e41bd4cd3865d4c.poster.avif?t=1746589459\" width=613 height=287 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2130300/extras/b0a8f110f027c2048e41bd4cd3865d4c.webm?t=1746589459\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2130300/extras/07e36c0540fd5dbf9180944abfa9598a.avif?t=1746589459\" width=613 height=273 /></span><br>- Original world-building with its own mythologies, regions, and creatures;<br>- Combo system with alternating between different weapons;<br>- Weapon evolution through mission-based system;<br>- Expandable universe.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2130300/extras/38ff8fe2585ded790238edd40e4dc8a4.poster.avif?t=1746589459\" width=613 height=287 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2130300/extras/38ff8fe2585ded790238edd40e4dc8a4.webm?t=1746589459\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2130300/extras/59577724c2d4af8eb4cfbe816d2f904b.webp?t=1746589459\" width=613 height=50 /></span><br>Follow Luke on his journey of power rise to fulfill his mission. Faced with the kidnapping of Prince Nylo, Luke finds himself in an inevitable situation of seeking to enhance his abilities to the maximum by facing his opponents along the way, so that at his peak, he can confront the imposing being of darkness, The Dark One. Join the hero on this fantastic journey full of mystery, action, and strong emotions. Enhance the legendary sword Suncatcher and the mythical weapons, mastering each of the available abilities to destroy the great evil.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2130300/extras/e629b5c3669c2c16e763a8e608bdafd8.poster.avif?t=1746589459\" width=613 height=287 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2130300/extras/e629b5c3669c2c16e763a8e608bdafd8.webm?t=1746589459\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2130300/extras/861664e965e773aacf0a3aafe73c6489.webp?t=1746589459\" width=613 height=50 /></span><br>Everyone seeks a higher goal in their journeys, and when two opposing paths cross, confrontation becomes inevitable. However, for every conflict, big or small, the glow of achievement ignites. Among conflicts, bonds are formed, perspectives change, and the flames that burned intensely can illuminate a new vision of each own journey.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"ano